config MI_RMAP_EFFICIENCY
	tristate "Xiaomi rmap efficiency optimization"
	depends on ANDROID_VENDOR_HOOKS
	depends on ANDROID_VENDOR_OEM_DATA
	default n
	help
	  Page mapcount-based reclaim optimization backported from Android 6.6.
	  Protects heavily shared pages from expensive rmap walks and TLB
	  shootdowns while preserving the Android 5.15 vendor hook ABI.
